# The control plane image's context: the Go module and nothing else. Docker
# finds this file beside the Containerfile; podman is handed it with
# --ignorefile (`make cp-image`). data/ (the Bots' workspaces), silo.yaml
# (keys), bin/, web/, ios/, node_modules and .git never reach the builder.
*
!go.mod
!go.sum
!gen
!internal
!cmd/silo
# A test run's leftovers and the tests themselves are not built.
internal/app/data
**/*_test.go
**/testdata
**/.DS_Store
